# Hintforge corpus .gitignore -- DENY-BY-DEFAULT.
# Generated by corpus-deploy from the resolved manifest's `vector-extensions:`.
# Nothing ships unless whitelisted below. User state/setup and dev scaffolding
# are excluded by NOT being listed -- the skill never has to predict them.
*
!.gitignore
!*/

# --- Fixed spine (universal core per docs/corpus-format.md) ---
# NOTE: CHECKPOINT.md is universal core too, but is DELIBERATELY excluded here --
# it is per-user playthrough state (player name, save slots, dials). Do not add it.
!nav/**
!architecture_manifest.md
!items/**
!sections/**
!_overflow/**
!achievements.md
!controls.md
!dependencies.md
!limitations.md
!mechanics.md
!persona.md
!settings.md
!warning_tiers.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!DISCLAIMER.md

# --- Release presentation (README + status card from step 4d) ---
!README.md
!assets/**

# --- Interactive artifacts: reusable TOOLS only ---
# The two collectible map pages ship built with no taken marks, with their base
# picture and the map config/data the reader and the map tool read.
# item_status.json (the player's marks) never ships; neither do scratch shots,
# the dev-only data generator or its join report.
!artifacts/full_map.html
!artifacts/full_map_all_markers.html
!artifacts/artifacts.json
!artifacts/shots/rdr2_mapgenie_z5.jpg
!extract_tools/collectible_map.json
!extract_tools/collectible_map_all.json
!extract_tools/collectible_catalog.json
!extract_tools/map_positions.json
!extract_tools/fast_travel_landmarks.json

# --- Declared vector-extensions (one !<ext>/** per manifest entry) ---
!npcs/**
!factions/**
!reputation/**
